# Finora backend base URL (public — never put secrets in frontend env vars).
#
# Dev (default): API_BASE is empty so /api requests stay same-origin and the
# Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) forwards them to the deployed Finora backend.
# Prod: no env var uses https://finora-api-dio1.onrender.com directly.
# Override with VITE_API_URL to point at another backend.
VITE_API_URL=https://finora-api-dio1.onrender.com